X.PP
X..
X.TH PHANTASIA 6 GAMES
X.UC 4
X.SH NAME
Xphantasia \- an interterminal fantasy game
X.SH SYNOPSIS
X.B phantasia
X[
X.B \-s
X] [
X.B \-m
X] [
X.B \-a
X] [
X.B \-x
X] [
X.B \-h
X] [
