X.B magic user
Xstrong in
X.B magic level
Xand
X.B brains
X, weak in other areas.	Must rely on wits and magic to survive.
X.TP 1.5i
X.B fighter
Xgood in
X.B strength
Xand
X.B energy level
X, fairly good in other areas.  This adds up to a well-equipped fighter.
X.TP 1.5i
X.B elf
Xvery high
X.B quickness
Xand above average
X.B magic level
Xare
X.B elves
Xselling points.
X.TP 1.5i
X.B dwarf
Xvery high
X.B strength
Xand
X.B energy level
X, but with a tendency to be rather slow and not too bright.
X.TP 1.5i
X.B halfling
Xrather quick and smart, with high
X.B energy level
X, but poor in
X.B magic
Xand
X.B strength.
XBorn with some
X.B experience.
X.TP 1.5i
X.B experimento
Xvery mediocre in all areas.  However, the
X.B experimento
Xmay be placed almost anywhere within the playing grid.
X.PP
XThe possible ranges for starting statistics are summarized in
